
Creates a new instance and sets the property values for the new instance.
USAGE:

CREATE <assign list>
NOTE: <assign list> can be more than one property name separated by commas.
Each property name should be followed by '=' and its value.

NOTE: Create cannot be used to create a new class.

The following properties are available:
Property				Type			Operation
========				====			=========
AccessMask                         	N/A                 	N/A       
Archive                            	N/A                 	N/A       
Description                        	N/A                 	N/A       
Drive                              	N/A                 	N/A       
EightDotThreeFileName              	N/A                 	N/A       
Encrypted                          	N/A                 	N/A       
EncryptionMethod                   	N/A                 	N/A       
Extension                          	N/A                 	N/A       
FSName                             	N/A                 	N/A       
FileName                           	N/A                 	N/A       
FileSize                           	N/A                 	N/A       
FileType                           	N/A                 	N/A       
Hidden                             	N/A                 	N/A       
InUseCount                         	N/A                 	N/A       
InstallDate                        	N/A                 	N/A       
LastAccessed                       	N/A                 	N/A       
LastModified                       	N/A                 	N/A       
LogfileName                        	N/A                 	N/A       
Manufacturer                       	N/A                 	N/A       
MaxFileSize                        	N/A                 	N/A       
Name                               	N/A                 	N/A       
NumberOfRecords                    	N/A                 	N/A       
OverWritePolicy                    	N/A                 	N/A       
OverwriteOutDated                  	N/A                 	N/A       
Path                               	N/A                 	N/A       
Readable                           	N/A                 	N/A       
Sources                            	N/A                 	N/A       
Status                             	N/A                 	N/A       
System                             	N/A                 	N/A       
Version                            	N/A                 	N/A       
Writeable                          	N/A                 	N/A       

